From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil Reif <pr@sambal.net>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:38:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(frontend): dice tray in the composer with a results card

A dice button next to the attachment button opens a tray to pick d4 to
d100, a modifier, or the Daggerheart duality dice. Rolling posts a !r
command for the dice bot into the room's dice thread when the tray knows
it. A card above the room composer shows the latest dice bot result, or
the latest result per player when the viewer's own latest roll was a GM
roll. It follows live events, thread replies included.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
